<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Our Love Story ❤️</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff9a9e,#fad0c4);
min-height:100vh;
overflow-x:hidden;
text-align:center;
color:white;
}

.login-box,.content{
padding:30px;
margin-top:100px;
}

input{
padding:12px;
border:none;
border-radius:10px;
width:220px;
margin-top:10px;
}

button{
padding:12px 25px;
border:none;
border-radius:10px;
background:#ff4d6d;
color:white;
cursor:pointer;
margin-top:10px;
}

button:hover{
background:#e63956;
}

.content{
display:none;
}

h1{
font-size:3rem;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.gallery{
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
flex-wrap:wrap;
gap:15px;
margin-top:30px;
}

.gallery img{
width:250px;
height:250px;
object-fit:cover;
border-radius:15px;
box-shadow:0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
}

.heart{
position:fixed;
color:red;
font-size:25px;
animation:float 6s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes float{
0%{
transform:translateY(100vh);
opacity:1;
}
100%{
transform:translateY(-100px);
opacity:0;
}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="login-box" id="login">
<h1>❤️ Secret Love Website ❤️</h1>
<p>Enter Password</p>
<input type="password" id="password" placeholder="Password">
<br>
<button onclick="checkPassword()">Open</button>
</div>

<div class="content" id="content">
<h1>❤️ Welcome My Love ❤️</h1>

<p style="font-size:22px;padding:20px;">
Every moment with you is special.<br>
Thank you for being part of my life. 💖
</p>

<h2>🌹 Our Beautiful Memories 🌹</h2>

<div class="gallery">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516589178581-6cd7833ae3b2?w=600">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524504388940-b1c1722653e1?w=600">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517841905240-472988babdf9?w=600">
</div>

<br><br>

<h2>💌 A Message For You 💌</h2>

<p style="max-width:700px;margin:auto;padding:20px;font-size:20px;">
No matter where life takes us,
you will always have a special place in my heart.
Every smile, every memory, every moment with you
means more than words can say. ❤️
</p>

</div>

<script>

function checkPassword(){
let pass=document.getElementById("password").value;

if(pass==="1310"){
document.getElementById("login").style.display="none";
document.getElementById("content").style.display="block";
}
else{
alert("Wrong Password ❤️");
}
}

function createHeart(){
const heart=document.createElement("div");
heart.classList.add("heart");
heart.innerHTML="❤️";
heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
heart.style.fontSize=(20+Math.random()*30)+"px";

document.body.appendChild(heart);

setTimeout(()=>{
heart.remove();
},6000);
}

setInterval(createHeart,400);

</script>

</body>
</html>
